   "why": "the grader is handed the owner's own roster (and a shuffled copy) and must return the same total. A harness that cannot reproduce a roster it was given is reporting differences it invented."
  },
  "C2_no_hindsight_in_the_choice": {
   "ok": true,
   "why": "buildSeat receives the draft and the roster state only. Actual points are not in scope at pick time — enforced by the function signature, not by discipline."
